HEN [Calculation_4173499882581135362]&#10;    WHEN &quot;Items per Customer&quot; THEN [Calculation_4173499882698080261]&#10;    WHEN &quot;CVR3 %&quot; THEN [Calculation_5714786486730915852] * 100&#10;    WHEN &quot;Sessions (Shop Details Loaded)&quot; THEN [Calculation_5714786486730272777]&#10;    WHEN &quot;Vendor Sessions as % of Platform Sessions&quot; THEN [Calculation_5714786486748798991] * 100&#10;END' />
